  "duration_s": 180.511927,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "周君，你相信吗？能量永远大于能力。道家有一个很高级的状态，叫如有神助。所谓天时不如地利地利，不如人和人和不如几何，几何不如神助。一个人开始走大运之前，身上往往会出现一些征兆。你会觉得冥冥之中好像有一股力量在推着你往前进，无论学什么，一看就懂一点就通。你遇到的人和事情也都像安排好一样，一切都是恰到好处。这便是如有神助，就是一个人最好的能量状态。朱君，你一定要给我记住啊。如果你做一件事情，既开心又有动力，还不怕辛苦，而且越做越兴奋，那这就是你的天赋，也是你的人生赛道，那些不费力就能得到也能看到的东西，这就是你的天赋。如果你曾经在某一个领域碾压过周围的人，哪怕只是班级名次，比赛名次，又或者是你某个技能远超同龄人，说明你骨子里就带着赢家的基因。你赢过，说明你曾经进入过自己的高能量状态。你只需要重新唤醒那个曾经势不可挡的自己，把当时那股劲儿带到当下来。你会发现东山再起，绝对可能人力百般周旋，不如天意。一似忽有老天爷出手帮你的时候，胜过你动用所有的力气。世间万般纠葛，冥冥之中自有安排，你不需要模仿谁也不需要成为谁。你只需要认出自己，道德经中说，反者道之动，你越是逆着自己的天性去用力努力。而那股反作用力就越强，最后把你拖得精疲力竭。我见过很多人，总是在逆天赋的领域里苦熬一个创业者，如果每天都要花时间解决自己的情绪问题，那便是被筛掉的那群人变强，就是让情绪穿过你，而不是控制你我见过很多人。比如做自媒体创业能力非常强，最后恰恰输给了能量的内耗。一条差评难受，三天，一次失败，怀疑半年。道德经中有一句极美的话，弗为不争，故天下莫能与之争当。你不再和自己较劲儿，不再在错误的赛道上拼命内卷，反而没有人跟你争，因为你走的那条路，只有你自己能走。一旦找到，不要轻易换赛道。你要真正的做到坚持，坚定的相信自己的持有，不要频繁看盘，你相信吗？真正高级的努力，从来不是逆着天性死磕，而是顺着天赋深挖，知人者智，自知者明，花有花期，树有树形。人生。真正的开窍就是终于认出自己究晶。请记住，一个人最好的风水是能量，最好的贵人是清醒，最好的运气是终于站对了自己的位置。你不需要成为别人，你只需要把自己这条生命活成他本来该成为的样子，那才是你最不拧巴，最有力量，也最值得的一生。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00001",
      "start_ms": 410,
      "end_ms": 810,
      "text": "周君，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1070,
      "end_ms": 1810,
      "text": "你相信吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00003",
      "start_ms": 2150,
      "end_ms": 4090,
      "text": "能量永远大于能力。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00004",
      "start_ms": 4630,
      "end_ms": 6250,
      "text": "道家有一个很高级的状态，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00005",
      "start_ms": 6250,
      "end_ms": 7750,
      "text": "叫如有神助。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00006",
      "start_ms": 8390,
      "end_ms": 10610,
      "text": "所谓天时不如地利地利，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00007",
      "start_ms": 10690,
      "end_ms": 13010,
      "text": "不如人和人和不如几何，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00008",
      "start_ms": 13230,
      "end_ms": 14630,
      "text": "几何不如神助。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00009",
      "start_ms": 15050,
      "end_ms": 16770,
      "text": "一个人开始走大运之前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00010",
      "start_ms": 16790,
      "end_ms": 18330,
      "text": "身上往往会出现一些征兆。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00011",
      "start_ms": 18750,
      "end_ms": 23350,
      "text": "你会觉得冥冥之中好像有一股力量在推着你往前进，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00012",
      "start_ms": 23850,
      "end_ms": 24790,
      "text": "无论学什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00013",
      "start_ms": 24970,
      "end_ms": 26770,
      "text": "一看就懂一点就通。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00014",
      "start_ms": 27110,
      "end_ms": 30095,
      "text": "你遇到的人和事情也都像安排好一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00015",
      "start_ms": 30240,
      "end_ms": 31640,
      "text": "一切都是恰到好处。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00016",
      "start_ms": 31800,
      "end_ms": 33080,
      "text": "这便是如有神助，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00017",
      "start_ms": 33240,
      "end_ms": 35120,
      "text": "就是一个人最好的能量状态。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00018",
      "start_ms": 35380,
      "end_ms": 35780,
      "text": "朱君，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00019",
      "start_ms": 36060,
      "end_ms": 37520,
      "text": "你一定要给我记住啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00020",
      "start_ms": 37680,
      "end_ms": 38880,
      "text": "如果你做一件事情，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00021",
      "start_ms": 39080,
      "end_ms": 40920,
      "text": "既开心又有动力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00022",
      "start_ms": 41000,
      "end_ms": 42060,
      "text": "还不怕辛苦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00023",
      "start_ms": 42140,
      "end_ms": 43920,
      "text": "而且越做越兴奋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00024",
      "start_ms": 44180,
      "end_ms": 45540,
      "text": "那这就是你的天赋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00025",
      "start_ms": 45680,
      "end_ms": 47080,
      "text": "也是你的人生赛道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00026",
      "start_ms": 47440,
      "end_ms": 50140,
      "text": "那些不费力就能得到也能看到的东西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00027",
      "start_ms": 50320,
      "end_ms": 51460,
      "text": "这就是你的天赋。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00028",
      "start_ms": 51740,
      "end_ms": 54720,
      "text": "如果你曾经在某一个领域碾压过周围的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00029",
      "start_ms": 54880,
      "end_ms": 56540,
      "text": "哪怕只是班级名次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00030",
      "start_ms": 56560,
      "end_ms": 57380,
      "text": "比赛名次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00031",
      "start_ms": 57480,
      "end_ms": 59680,
      "text": "又或者是你某个技能远超同龄人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00032",
      "start_ms": 59680,
      "end_ms": 62725,
      "text": "说明你骨子里就带着赢家的基因。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00033",
      "start_ms": 63130,
      "end_ms": 63830,
      "text": "你赢过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00034",
      "start_ms": 63990,
      "end_ms": 66645,
      "text": "说明你曾经进入过自己的高能量状态。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00035",
      "start_ms": 66860,
      "end_ms": 70735,
      "text": "你只需要重新唤醒那个曾经势不可挡的自己，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00036",
      "start_ms": 71040,
      "end_ms": 73080,
      "text": "把当时那股劲儿带到当下来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00037",
      "start_ms": 73220,
      "end_ms": 75300,
      "text": "你会发现东山再起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00038",
      "start_ms": 75300,
      "end_ms": 78150,
      "text": "绝对可能人力百般周旋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00039",
      "start_ms": 78150,
      "end_ms": 78870,
      "text": "不如天意。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00040",
      "start_ms": 78870,
      "end_ms": 81560,
      "text": "一似忽有老天爷出手帮你的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00041",
      "start_ms": 81560,
      "end_ms": 83385,
      "text": "胜过你动用所有的力气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00042",
      "start_ms": 83800,
      "end_ms": 85240,
      "text": "世间万般纠葛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00043",
      "start_ms": 85320,
      "end_ms": 86785,
      "text": "冥冥之中自有安排，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00044",
      "start_ms": 87210,
      "end_ms": 89630,
      "text": "你不需要模仿谁也不需要成为谁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00045",
      "start_ms": 89790,
      "end_ms": 91675,
      "text": "你只需要认出自己，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00046",
      "start_ms": 92020,
      "end_ms": 92920,
      "text": "道德经中说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00047",
      "start_ms": 93240,
      "end_ms": 94480,
      "text": "反者道之动，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00048",
      "start_ms": 94740,
      "end_ms": 97440,
      "text": "你越是逆着自己的天性去用力努力。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00049",
      "start_ms": 97440,
      "end_ms": 99220,
      "text": "而那股反作用力就越强，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00050",
      "start_ms": 99240,
      "end_ms": 101075,
      "text": "最后把你拖得精疲力竭。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00051",
      "start_ms": 101350,
      "end_ms": 102230,
      "text": "我见过很多人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00052",
      "start_ms": 102390,
      "end_ms": 106165,
      "text": "总是在逆天赋的领域里苦熬一个创业者，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00053",
      "start_ms": 106440,
      "end_ms": 109240,
      "text": "如果每天都要花时间解决自己的情绪问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00054",
      "start_ms": 109480,
      "end_ms": 111930,
      "text": "那便是被筛掉的那群人变强，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00055",
      "start_ms": 112190,
      "end_ms": 113810,
      "text": "就是让情绪穿过你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00056",
      "start_ms": 113830,
      "end_ms": 116070,
      "text": "而不是控制你我见过很多人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00057",
      "start_ms": 116090,
      "end_ms": 118610,
      "text": "比如做自媒体创业能力非常强，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00058",
      "start_ms": 118770,
      "end_ms": 121315,
      "text": "最后恰恰输给了能量的内耗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00059",
      "start_ms": 121640,
      "end_ms": 122720,
      "text": "一条差评难受，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00060",
      "start_ms": 122720,
      "end_ms": 123145,
      "text": "三天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00061",
      "start_ms": 123410,
      "end_ms": 124110,
      "text": "一次失败，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00062",
      "start_ms": 124130,
      "end_ms": 124755,
      "text": "怀疑半年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00063",
      "start_ms": 125130,
      "end_ms": 126975,
      "text": "道德经中有一句极美的话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00064",
      "start_ms": 127310,
      "end_ms": 128050,
      "text": "弗为不争，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00065",
      "start_ms": 128110,
      "end_ms": 130340,
      "text": "故天下莫能与之争当。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00066",
      "start_ms": 130340,
      "end_ms": 131960,
      "text": "你不再和自己较劲儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00067",
      "start_ms": 131960,
      "end_ms": 134144,
      "text": "不再在错误的赛道上拼命内卷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00068",
      "start_ms": 134430,
      "end_ms": 135590,
      "text": "反而没有人跟你争，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00069",
      "start_ms": 135610,
      "end_ms": 137130,
      "text": "因为你走的那条路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00070",
      "start_ms": 137170,
      "end_ms": 138310,
      "text": "只有你自己能走。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00071",
      "start_ms": 138470,
      "end_ms": 139270,
      "text": "一旦找到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00072",
      "start_ms": 139450,
      "end_ms": 140870,
      "text": "不要轻易换赛道。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00073",
      "start_ms": 141010,
      "end_ms": 142755,
      "text": "你要真正的做到坚持，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00074",
      "start_ms": 143160,
      "end_ms": 145000,
      "text": "坚定的相信自己的持有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00075",
      "start_ms": 145140,
      "end_ms": 146505,
      "text": "不要频繁看盘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00076",
      "start_ms": 146950,
      "end_ms": 147650,
      "text": "你相信吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00077",
      "start_ms": 147790,
      "end_ms": 148970,
      "text": "真正高级的努力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00078",
      "start_ms": 148970,
      "end_ms": 150610,
      "text": "从来不是逆着天性死磕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00079",
      "start_ms": 150750,
      "end_ms": 152625,
      "text": "而是顺着天赋深挖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00080",
      "start_ms": 153140,
      "end_ms": 154085,
      "text": "知人者智，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00081",
      "start_ms": 154390,
      "end_ms": 155265,
      "text": "自知者明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00082",
      "start_ms": 155620,
      "end_ms": 156475,
      "text": "花有花期，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00083",
      "start_ms": 156790,
      "end_ms": 157635,
      "text": "树有树形。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00084",
      "start_ms": 158000,
      "end_ms": 158440,
      "text": "人生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00085",
      "start_ms": 158500,
      "end_ms": 162070,
      "text": "真正的开窍就是终于认出自己究晶。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00086",
      "start_ms": 162540,
      "end_ms": 163060,
      "text": "请记住，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00087",
      "start_ms": 163320,
      "end_ms": 165275,
      "text": "一个人最好的风水是能量，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00088",
      "start_ms": 165550,
      "end_ms": 167095,
      "text": "最好的贵人是清醒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00089",
      "start_ms": 167380,
      "end_ms": 170205,
      "text": "最好的运气是终于站对了自己的位置。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00090",
      "start_ms": 170690,
      "end_ms": 172105,
      "text": "你不需要成为别人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00091",
      "start_ms": 172380,
      "end_ms": 175960,
      "text": "你只需要把自己这条生命活成他本来该成为的样子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00092",
      "start_ms": 176120,
      "end_ms": 177800,
      "text": "那才是你最不拧巴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00093",
      "start_ms": 177900,
      "end_ms": 178635,
      "text": "最有力量，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_401910a7503af68e_s00094",
      "start_ms": 178810,
      "end_ms": 180225,
      "text": "也最值得的一生。"
    }
  ],
